[Desktop Entry]
Name=Go links and tiling
Comment=go/* links in a new browser window; the KWin tiles editor
Type=Service
Icon=internet-web-browser
X-KDE-PluginInfo-Name=org.niteris.go-runner
X-KDE-PluginInfo-EnabledByDefault=true
X-Plasma-API=DBus
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Service=org.niteris.GoRunner
X-Plasma-DBusRunner-Path=/runner
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntaxes=go/:q:,tile
X-Plasma-Runner-Syntax-Descriptions=Opens http://go/:q: in a new browser window,Opens the KWin tiles editor (Meta+T)
